# Chronomantic Escape ({4}{W}{W}): "Until your next turn, creatures can't attack you. Exile Chronomantic Escape with three time
# counters on it." Bot2's Savannah Lions attack on turn four, before the spell; Bot1 casts it on turn five, so the rule (CR
# 611.2c) takes in the Lions and bars their attack on turn six. It lasts until Bot1's next turn begins (CR 611.2b), so on
# turn eight the Lions attack again. The card exiles itself as it resolves, with the three time counters (CR 702.62a).

